# HAWS — Human-AI Working Standard (.cursorrules)

This repository operates under the Human-AI Working Standard (HAWS).

## Core Standards
- **Core Standard**: core/HAWS.md
- **Work Instructions**: core/WORK_INSTRUCTIONS.md
- **Second Brain**: secondbrain/ (or core/USER_PREFERENCES.md and core/ANTI_PATTERNS.md)

## Repository Contracts
- **Quality Gates**: CONSTRAINTS.md
- **Agent Boundaries**: AGENTS.md
- **Architecture**: ARCHITECTURE.md
- **Handoff State**: HANDOFF.md

## Critical Invariants
1. Verify before completion: Execute commands and verify exit codes before asserting completion.
2. Preserve existing comments, docstrings, and types.
3. Enforce strict LF line endings across all files.
4. Zero secret leaks.
